  "question": {
    "text": "In first order reaction, the concentration of the reactant decreases from $0.8 \\mathrm{M}$ to $0.4 \\mathrm{M}$ in 15 minutes. The time taken for the concentration to change from $0.1 \\mathrm{M}$ to $0.025 \\mathrm{M}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
